* NADOC C3 thiolate DNA terminal patches for implicit-gold simulations
*
36 1

! Atom types are CHARMM36 NA/protein types.  The organic charges give an
! integer -1 terminal nucleotide after replacing the 5TER/3TER hydroxyl H.
! Sulfur is Au-bound thiolate: no S-H atom is present.

PRES NP5C        -1.00
DELETE ATOM H5T
ATOM O5'  ON2    -0.57
ATOM PLK  P       1.50
ATOM O1L  ON3    -0.78
ATOM O2L  ON3    -0.78
ATOM O4L  ON2    -0.57
ATOM C3L  CT2    -0.18
ATOM H31  HA2     0.09
ATOM H32  HA2     0.09
ATOM C2L  CT2    -0.18
ATOM H21  HA2     0.09
ATOM H22  HA2     0.09
ATOM C1L  CT2     0.02
ATOM H11  HA2     0.09
ATOM H12  HA2     0.09
ATOM SNP  S      -0.23
BOND O5' PLK  PLK O1L  PLK O2L  PLK O4L
BOND O4L C3L  C3L C2L  C2L C1L  C1L SNP
BOND C3L H31  C3L H32  C2L H21  C2L H22  C1L H11  C1L H12
IC C5' O5' PLK O4L  1.43 109.5  1.60 109.5  1.60
IC O5' PLK O4L C3L  1.60 109.5  1.60 109.5  1.43
IC PLK O4L C3L C2L  1.60 109.5  1.43 112.0  1.53
IC O4L C3L C2L C1L  1.43 112.0  1.53 112.0  1.53
IC C3L C2L C1L SNP  1.53 112.0  1.53 114.5  1.818
IC H31 C2L *C3L H32  1.09 109.5 109.5 109.5 1.09
IC H21 C1L *C2L H22  1.09 109.5 109.5 109.5 1.09
IC H11 SNP *C1L H12  1.09 109.5 109.5 109.5 1.09

PRES NP3C        -1.00
DELETE ATOM H3T
ATOM O3'  ON2    -0.57
ATOM PLK  P       1.50
ATOM O1L  ON3    -0.78
ATOM O2L  ON3    -0.78
ATOM O4L  ON2    -0.57
ATOM C3L  CT2    -0.18
ATOM H31  HA2     0.09
ATOM H32  HA2     0.09
ATOM C2L  CT2    -0.18
ATOM H21  HA2     0.09
ATOM H22  HA2     0.09
ATOM C1L  CT2     0.02
ATOM H11  HA2     0.09
ATOM H12  HA2     0.09
ATOM SNP  S      -0.23
BOND O3' PLK  PLK O1L  PLK O2L  PLK O4L
BOND O4L C3L  C3L C2L  C2L C1L  C1L SNP
BOND C3L H31  C3L H32  C2L H21  C2L H22  C1L H11  C1L H12
IC C4' C3' O3' PLK  1.53 109.5  1.43 109.5  1.60
IC C3' O3' PLK O4L  1.43 109.5  1.60 109.5  1.60
IC O3' PLK O4L C3L  1.60 109.5  1.60 109.5  1.43
IC PLK O4L C3L C2L  1.60 109.5  1.43 112.0  1.53
IC O4L C3L C2L C1L  1.43 112.0  1.53 112.0  1.53
IC C3L C2L C1L SNP  1.53 112.0  1.53 114.5  1.818
IC H31 C2L *C3L H32  1.09 109.5 109.5 109.5 1.09
IC H21 C1L *C2L H22  1.09 109.5 109.5 109.5 1.09
IC H11 SNP *C1L H12  1.09 109.5 109.5 109.5 1.09

END
